{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"ce7809e3316f78c0","type":"text","text":"[[Dolor Matris]]\n#DolorMatris","x":-480,"y":-380,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"0d6b011bf9298e08","type":"text","text":"A large castle entrance with cracked flooring that was once marble but is now covered in dirt a debris","x":-480,"y":-280,"width":427,"height":112},
		{"id":"f712625c86604814","type":"text","text":"To the Left:\n\nA large open walk way leading to a series of rooms","x":-684,"y":51,"width":329,"height":189},
		{"id":"f24e88b4d57addff","type":"file","file":"Domains of Dread/images/Pasted image 20260919104809.png","x":640,"y":-224,"width":460,"height":674},
		{"id":"2020320e639ca626","type":"text","text":"3rd Left: \n\nA small study with a written letter on the desk.","x":-1045,"y":385,"width":388,"height":291},
		{"id":"7bf441912d96a599","type":"text","text":"First Left:\n\nA whole leading to the abyss below","x":-1050,"y":1220,"width":398,"height":290},
		{"id":"fe925f04c12eabb6","type":"text","text":"2nd Left: \n\nA wooden chamber with wine bottles stack high in shelves and a singular chair beside a glass table. with the view of what at one point woud've been a nation.","x":-1055,"y":755,"width":409,"height":360},
		{"id":"8d711a10642c9c86","type":"text","text":"","x":-400,"y":1190,"width":432,"height":320},
		{"id":"1363ae3d98e6d3ac","type":"text","text":"To the Right: dinning hall\n\nA open arch leading to a grand dinning hall that spans 200 feet in length with a glass roof that has a view of the skies above beyond its shattered distortions. \n\nOn the arch way are markings cut into the archway with the name Maelle and a date\n\nwalls with tapestries and in the center of them the symbol on the right.\n\nAt the back left there is a door","x":80,"y":11,"width":448,"height":435},
		{"id":"3576bae4f95561da","type":"text","text":"The Kitchen:\n\nA small kitchen with old disregarded utensils and dead bodies that have become skeletons.\n\nAt the left corner there is a metal door which leads to a cellar. All the food within has rotted.","x":80,"y":516,"width":448,"height":300},
		{"id":"b05917f4893efbea","type":"text","text":"","x":-400,"y":785,"width":432,"height":330},
